{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99826","id":2207041578,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6DjMgq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99826","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99826.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99826.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99826","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99826/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99826/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99826/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e4f8a7f8cf5eb14edbebb0636a5e87e357c6e784","number":99826,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Improve `parse_utf8` performance","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Improve parseUtf8 performance.\r\n\r\nAll the timings are using the rdtsc instruction, the lower the better.\r\n\r\n Timings using a 9mb GLTF file from this [issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98893) averaged on 6000 calls of the function. **Old len** is the current implementation with the length of the string passed in, **Old -1**  is the current implementation without the length of the string passed in. **New** is the proposed implementation.\r\n![GLTF_FileComparison](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0226770-03f1-452a-8c93-2fb56f244e9c)\r\nWent from 3 083 895 cycles down to 1 816 624 cycles.\r\n\r\nTimings using a 6mb Ascii file from [here](https://github.com/dscape/spell/blob/master/test/resources/big.txt) averaged on 15 000 calls of the function.\r\n![UTF8File_comparison](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/83c24d50-56f4-4540-a6bd-47a7b88a80dd)\r\nWent from 50 741 668 cycles down to 30 046 082 cycles.\r\n\r\nTested the output using [utf8tests](https://github.com/flenniken/utf8tests/tree/main). Now passes all the section, except the _Null Characters_ section (being able to have a 0 byte inside a longer string), but this is to be expected as changing this would probably break a lot of usage code.\r\n\r\nRegarding tests, I had to remove the non standard ones, as it is now closer to standard. I replaced them with examples from the [unicode standard specification](https://www.unicode.org/versions/Unicode16.0.0/UnicodeStandard-16.0.pdf). \r\n\r\nSome tests from other people would be nice, as this seems pretty widely used through the engine. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwz